WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.675
In 2016, the system launched despite explicit internal warnings.

00:00:05.625 --> 00:00:10.600
Within weeks, tens of thousands experienced severe pay failures.

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:18.650
By 2018, the Auditor General labeled the project an incomprehensible failure of project management and oversight.
